      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Seedance 2.0 Mini films **Scene** with the host from **Keep** in the place from **Place**, four seconds at `720p` in a `9:16` frame. With an Element connected, the node uses `m2v`, the mode that takes references.\n\nA cancel does not stop a video Dreamina has accepted. It keeps running and is billed. Collect it with **Generation: Download** in **video-04-recover-a-video**."
      ],
      "title": "Note"
    },
